# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates, for `--worktree`,
# for `EnterWorktree`, and for a subagent with `isolation: worktree`.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so none of these are present in it, and each one
# fails in its own confusing way when absent: without pubspec_overrides.yaml the
# siblings resolve from pub.dev instead of the local working trees, a missing
# backend/.env aborts artisan before it says why, and a missing .artisan/plugins.json
# drops every plugin command.
#
# `.gitignore` syntax, and only files that match AND are gitignored are copied, so a
# tracked file can never be duplicated by this list.
#
# NOT processed when a WorktreeCreate hook replaces the default git logic; such a hook
# has to copy these itself. This project has no such hook, deliberately.

pubspec_overrides.yaml
backend/.env
.artisan/plugins.json
